{"step_index":1170,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T17:05:19Z","content":"You are 100% right. Immediate visual feedback is essential so the user knows the AI is actively working on the photo.\n\n### Why It Appeared Frozen\nIn the screen's conditional rendering logic, the initial button view was taking precedence over the `isProcessing` state while Gemini AI was running. As a result, the camera closed and the screen remained on the static initial button layout for the 3–5 seconds of OCR processing before suddenly jumping to the review screen.\n\n---\n\n### What Has Been Implemented\n\n1. **Immediate Processing State Transition:**\n   - As soon as a photo is taken or picked from the library, `isProcessing` engages immediately.\n\n2. **Live AI Processing Visualizer ([`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx)):**\n   - **Photo Thumbnail Preview**: Displays a rounded card preview of the snapped report card with a Heavenly Gold glowing border.\n   - **Activity Spinner**: Smooth spinning indicator in `#D4AF37`.\n   - **Dynamic Header & Status**: Header switches to *\"Processing Card...\"* with clear subtext: *\"Analyzing Report Card with Gemini AI...\"*.\n   - **Step-by-Step Status Checklist**:\n     - 🔍 *Scanning handwriting & contact info*\n     - 🏫 *Extracting planning period & room number*\n     - 📝 *Capturing FRS needs & written questions*\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Production Deployment Live\nThe update has been compiled and deployed live:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
{"step_index":1171,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-21T17:10:40Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nthere is a section in the main dashboard that tracks 'Sit-Downs'.  In concept that is good, however it should be more indicative of an appointment being set from the call...'Appointments Set'  there should be some way in the power dialer screen to disposition the call as 'Appt. Set' in addition to the other disposition options.  what are your thoughts?  my goal is to be able to used this app to not only keep all old and new lead data at the users finger tips, but to also track the most important KPIs as related to calling leads like these.\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-08-21T13:10:40-04:00.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
